Two instances are extant, one with annotations (ID:4423) one without (ID:4428).</note><idno type="APIS">4424</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4427"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mngon par rtogs pa'i bshad pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">མངོན་པར་རྟོགས་པའི་བཤད་པ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal mngon par rtogs pa'i dka' ba’i gnas bshad pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal mngon par rtogs pa'i bshad pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal mngon par rtogs pa'i dka' ba'i gnas bshad pa lo tsA ba rin chen bzang pos mdzad pa bzhugs</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mngon par rtogs pa'i dka' gnad</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal mngon par rtogs pa'i dka' gnad</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1042-01-01" notAfter="1054-12-31">after 1042 before 1054</date><author ref="person:3784">rin chen bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Rin chen bzang po is reporting the teaching of Atiśa (ID:3745) on the Śrī-(Cakrasaṃvara-)Abhisamaya. The text refers to the words of the Cakrasaṃvara-Abhisamaya. The explanations find parallels in Atiśa’s Abhisamayavibhaṅga (ID: 6213) (see &lt;&lt;Kano and Kawasaki 2014 [IWEZ79V4]&gt;&gt; for cross-references).</note><idno type="APIS">4427</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4431"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bde ba can gyi smon lam</title><title xml:lang="bo">བདེ་བ་ཅན་གྱི་སྨོན་ལམ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bde can smon lam</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bde can zhing gi smon lam</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bde ba can gyi smon lam</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bDe ba can gyi smon lam</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="0996-01-01">after 996</date><author ref="person:3784">rin chen bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Prayer for Sukhavatī in verses of 9 syllables. Assuming the place of composition stands for Tho ling, composed between 996 (foundation of the monastery) and 1055 (author's passing).</note><idno type="APIS">4431</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5333"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgyud sde'i spyi'i rnam par bzhag pa 'thad ldan lung gi rgyan gyis spras pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">རྒྱུད་སྡེའི་སྤྱིའི་རྣམ་པར་བཞག་པ་འཐད་ལྡན་ལུང་གི་རྒྱན་གྱིས་སྤྲས་པ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgyud sde spyi'i rnam par bzhag pa 'thad ldan lung gi rgyan gyis spras pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1000-01-01" notAfter="1055-12-31">after 1000 before 1055</date><author ref="person:3784">rin chen bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">5333</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5335"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dam tshig mdor bsdus pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">དམ་ཚིག་མདོར་བསྡུས་པ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gdams pa dam tshig mdor bsdus pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">slob dpon rin chen bzang pos gsungs pa'i dam tshig mdor bsdus bstan pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">slob dpon rin chen bzang pos gsungs pa'i dam tshig mdor bsdus ba bstan pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sdom pa dam tshig mdor bsdus pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="0968-01-01" notAfter="1055-12-31">after 968 before 1055</date><author ref="person:4593">Anonymous</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">The title "sdom pa dam tshig mdor bsdus pa" is reported in [2PUVZG5F]: 46.&#13;
A post-colophon addition in (ID:5334) reports that the teaching of that text was requested by "rngos" (whom a gloss in dbu can identifies as "mar ston") from "lca/lba ston jo dga'" (lca/lba ston jo dga' la rngos ‹mar ston› kyis mnyan zhus nan tan bgyis so). Dan Martin (who reads "lba ston") notes "There was a Jo-dga' in the western Tibetan royal lineage whose lifespan could have coincided with Rinchen Zangpo's (Roerich’s Blue Annals, p. 38)" ([F8AC4NRI]). See [R894SIKE]: 63 for the reference to "jo dga'".</note><idno type="APIS">5335</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5624"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pratiṣṭhāvidhi</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rab tu gnas pa'i cho ga</title><author ref="person:5625">ānandagarbha</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">D2523</note><idno type="APIS">5624</idno></bibl></listBibl><listPlace><place xml:id="place6216"><placeName xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tho ling</placeName><placeName xml:lang="bo">ཐོ་ལིང</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">thon mthing gi gtsug lag khang</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">mtho lding</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">tho gling</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">mtho lding gser gyi lha khang</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">mtho lding rdo rje gdan</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">mtho lding dgon pa</placeName><placeName type="alt" xml:lang="bo">dpal dpe med lhun gyis grub pa</placeName><location><geo>31.48314909153566 79.79735820745925</geo></location><idno type="APIS">6216</idno></place></listPlace><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel7307" name="student-of" active="#person3784" passive="#person3745" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel7408" name="lineage-predecessor-of" active="#person8218" passive="#person3784" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel4069" name="student-of" active="#person3784" passive="#person5639" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel523" name="author-of" active="#person3784" passive="#work4422" type="positive"><desc>Evidence: <ptr target="#ex1012023-01-2014-22-39"/></desc></relation><relation xml:id="rel526" name="author-of" active="#person3784" passive="#work4424" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel524" name="author-of" active="#person3784" passive="#work4427" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel4028" name="translator-of" active="#person3784" passive="#work3701" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel7409" name="lineage-predecessor-of" active="#person3784" passive="#person8185" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel4063" name="translator-of" active="#person3784" passive="#work5624" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel4023" name="active-at" active="#person3784" passive="#place6216" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel1077" name="author-of" active="#person3784" passive="#work5333" type="uncertain"/><relation xml:id="rel527" name="author-of" active="#person3784" passive="#work4431" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel5648" name="records-the-teaching-of" active="#work5335" passive="#person3784" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel2922" name="student-of" active="#person3788" passive="#person3784" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel2593" name="student-of" active="#person6189" passive="#person3784" type="positive"/></listRelation></standOff><text>
      <body>
         <ab xml:space="preserve" type="cover_page">
               <seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex1012023-01-2014-17-31" part="I" next="ex001012025-09-1509-01-56" status="finalized">
                  <milestone unit="section" n="Cover page (1a)"/>
                  <pb n="1a"/>
                  <lb n="1a1"/> ||  <rs type="work" ref="work:4422" ana="corpusmd:named_reference">dpal 'khor lo bde mchog lU i pa'i bstod pa yid bzhin nor bu</rs> <expan>bzhugs s+ho</expan> ||
               </seg>
         </ab>

         <ab xml:space="preserve" type="text_body">
            <seg type="shared" part="M" xml:id="ex001012025-09-1509-01-56" next="ex1012023-01-2014-22-39" status="reviewed">
               <milestone unit="section" n="Body of the text (1b1–2a5)"/>
               <milestone unit="section" n="1"/>
               <pb n="1b"/> 
                  <lg>
                     <l><lb n="1b1"/> gang gis 'khor ba'i nyaMs thag ni ||</l>
                     <l>dran pa bal gyis 'joMs mdzad cing ||</l>
                     <l>bla med <expan>byang chub</expan> thob mdzad pa ||</l>
                     <l>bla ma'i zhabs la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

                <milestone unit="section" n="2"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l>skye med ngang mas thugs rje <expan>chen po</expan> yis ||</l>
                     <l>keng rus <note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 reads "keng sdus" and corrects to "keng rus."</note> <lb n="1b2"/> <expan>'jigs</expan> su rung pa'i gdan stengs su<note type="editorial">"su"is followed by a <mentioned>tsheg</mentioned> before the double <mentioned>shad</mentioned></note> ||</l>
                     <l>bdud 'dul hUM las <expan>khro bo</expan>'i sku sprul ba ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">bcom ldan bde ba'i mchog</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="3"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l>chos dbyings rnaM dag 'gyur med <expan>nam mkha'</expan> la ||</l>
                     <l>mtshon pa'i skur bstan dpa' bo'i rgyan gyis spras ||</l>
                     <l> <lb n="1b3"/> thabs dang <expan>shes rab</expan> <expan>gnyis</expan> med rol ba mdzad ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">bcom ldan bde ba'i mchog</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="4"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l>dpa' bo'i stang<note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 corrects to "stangs"</note> stabs khro bo 'jigs su rung ||</l>
                     <l>sgeg pa'i nyaMs can <expan>snogs</expan> rgyan gyis spras ||</l>
                     <l><expan>rgod dang</expan> mi sdug snying rjes zhi ba mdzad ||</l>
                     <l> <lb n="1b4"/> 'gal ba'i chos 'chang <rs type="deity">bde mchog</rs> <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="5"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l>gang la <expan>chags</expan> dang sdang ba mi mnga' yang ||</l>
                     <l>gang gis 'dul ba <choice><reg>de dang</reg><orig>‹de dang›</orig>
                  </choice> de'i sras ||</l>
                     <l><expan>chags</expan> sogs <expan>nyon mongs</expan> kun tu zhi mdzad pa'i ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">bcom ldan bde ba'i mchog</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="6"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l>sgrib <expan>gnyis</expan> <lb n="1b5"/> nyes pa'i rgyu <expan>tshogs</expan> <expan>rnaM par</expan> <choice><reg>spangs</reg><orig>spang‹s›</orig></choice><note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 reads "sprangs"</note></l>
                     <l><expan>sdug bsngal</expan> <expan>'bras bu'i</expan><note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 reads "'bras bu"</note> <expan>tshogs</expan> dang bral ba nyid ||</l>
                     <l>'khor dang <expan>mya ngan</expan> 'da'<note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 corrects to "'das"</note> la mi gnas pa'i ||</l>
                     <l><expan>gnyis</expan> med <expan>ye shes</expan> <rs type="deity">bde mchog</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="7"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l>dag pa chos sku'i sprul pa ni ||</l>
                     <l><expan>dmigs</expan> pa med pa'i <lb n="1b6"/> <expan>thugs rje</expan> yis ||</l>
                     <l><expan>gzugs</expan> sku sgyu ma ltar ston pa ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">rdo rje phag mo</rs> <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="8"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><expan>ye shes</expan> <expan>bzhi</expan>'i ngo bo yi ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">mkha' 'gro</rs> <rs type="deity">la ma</rs> <rs type="deity">dum skyes ma</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">gzugs can ma</rs> dang thod pa <expan>bzhi</expan> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">bde chen 'khor lo</rs> phyag 'tshal lo ||</l>
                  </lg><note type="gloss">'khor lo gsum gyi °°° rnaMs la bstod pa ni ||</note>

               <milestone unit="section" n="9"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><rs type="deity">rab tu gtum<note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 reads: <mentioned>stum</mentioned></note></rs><rs type="deity">gtuM mig</rs> <lb n="1b7"/>||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">'od ldan sna tshogs<note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 corrects to: <mentioned>sna chen</mentioned></note></rs> <rs type="deity">brtan pa'i blo</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">mi thung</rs> <rs type="deity">lang ka'i dbang phyug ma</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">shing grib ma</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="10"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><rs type="deity">sa bsrungs ma</rs> dang <rs type="deity">'jigs byed che</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">rlung shugs</rs> <rs type="deity">chang 'thung</rs> <rs type="deity">ljang lha mo</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><pb n="2a"/> <lb n="2a1"/> <rs type="deity">shin tu bzang mo</rs> <rs type="deity">rta sna mo</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">bya gdong ma</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal</expan> lo ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="11"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><rs type="deity">'khor shug</rs><note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 corrects to "shugs"</note> <rs type="deity">kha NDa ro ha</rs> dang ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">chang 'thung</rs> <rs type="deity">go cha</rs> <rs type="deity">rab dpa' mo</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">stobs chen</rs> <rs type="deity">'khor lo bsgyur ma</rs> dang ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">brtson chen ma</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal</expan> lo ||</l>
                  </lg>
               <note type="gloss">dpa' ba rnaMs la bstod pa ni ||</note>
               <milestone unit="section" n="12"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><rs type="deity">thod pa'i <lb n="2a2"/> dum bu</rs> <rs type="deity">keng rus<note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 reads "sdus"</note> che</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">keng rus<note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 reads: <mentioned>sdus</mentioned></note></rs> <rs type="deity">mche rtsigs</rs> <rs type="deity">lha'i sgra</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">'od dpag med</rs> dang <rs type="deity">rdo rje'i 'od</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">rdo rje sku</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal</expan> bstod ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="13"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><rs type="deity">myu gu can</rs> dang <rs type="deity">ral pa can</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">dpa' chen</rs> <rs type="deity">hUM mdzad</rs> <rs type="deity">rab tu bzang<note type="editorial">Misprint in Kawasaki 2007 "bṇang"</note></rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">rdo rje bzang</rs> dang <lb n="2a3"/> <rs type="deity">'jigs byed che</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">mig mi bzang</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="14"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><rs type="deity">stobs chen</rs> <rs type="deity">rin chen rdo rje</rs> dang ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">rta mgrin</rs> <rs type="deity">mkha' snying</rs> <rs type="deity">he ru ka</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">padma gar dbang</rs> <rs type="deity">rnaM snang</rs> dang ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">rdo rje seMs</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>
               <note type="gloss">sgo 'tshams ma brgyad la bstod pa ni ||</note>
               <milestone unit="section" n="15"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l>phyogs <expan>bzhi</expan>'i sgo rnaMs skyong mdzad <lb n="2a4"/>
 pa ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">khwa gdong ma</rs> dang <rs type="deity">'ug gdong ma</rs> ||</l>
                     <l>de <expan>bzhin</expan> <rs type="deity">khyi'i gdong ma                </rs> dang ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">phag gdong<note type="editorial">Kawasaki 2007 reads "phag dong"</note> ma</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>

               <milestone unit="section" n="16"/>
                  <lg>
                     <l><expan>gzugs</expan> <expan>gnyis</expan> kyis ni yid 'phrog ma ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">brtan pa mo</rs> dang <rs type="deity">pho nya mo</rs> ||</l>
                     <l><rs type="deity">mche brtsigs ma</rs> dang <rs type="deity">'joMs ma</rs> dang ||</l>
                      <l><rs type="deity">gshin rje <lb n="2a5"/> bzhi</rs> la <expan>phyag 'tshal lo</expan> ||</l>
                  </lg>
            </seg>
         </ab>

         <ab xml:space="preserve" type="colophon">
            <seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex1012023-01-2014-22-39" part="F" status="finalized" ana="corpusmd:colophon">
               <milestone unit="section" n="Colophon (2a5)"/>
               <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3784">lots+tsha ba <expan>rin chen</expan> bzang po</rs>s <rs type="work" ref="work:4422" ana="corpusmd:named_reference">bstod pa</rs> <expan>rdzogs</expan> s+ho ||   || dge'o ||</seg>
         </ab>
      </body>
